&radic;3</p><p>(&radic;6 &#8722; &radic;2)<sup>2</sup> = 6 + 2 &#8722; 2&radic;12 = 8 &#8722; 4&radic;3</p><p>Difference = (8 + 4&radic;3) &#8722; (8 &#8722; 4&radic;3) = 8&radic;3</p><p>[(&radic;6 + &radic;2)<sup>2</sup> &#8722; (&radic;6 &#8722; &radic;2)<sup>2</sup>] / (6 &#8722; 2) = 8&radic;3 / 4 = 2&radic;3</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify: &radic;(8 + 2&radic;15) &#8722; &radic;(8 &#8722; 2&radic;15)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;: &radic;(8 + 2&radic;15) &#8722; &radic;(8 &#8722; 2&radic;15)</p>", "options_en": ["2&radic;2", "2&radic;3", "&radic;15", "&radic;5"], "options_hi": ["2&radic;2", "2&radic;3", "&radic;15", "&radic;5"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>8 &#177; 2&radic;15 = (&radic;3 &#177; &radic;5)&#178;</p><p>&radic;(8 + 2&radic;15) = &radic;3 + &radic;5</p><p>&radic;(8 &#8722; 2&radic;15) = &radic;5 &#8722; &radic;3</p><p>Difference = (&radic;3 + &radic;5) &#8722; (&radic;5 &#8722; &radic;3) = 2&radic;3</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>8 &#177; 2&radic;15 = (&radic;3 &#177; &radic;5)&#178;</p><p>&radic;(8 + 2&radic;15) = &radic;3 + &radic;5</p><p>&radic;(8 &#8722; 2&radic;15) = &radic;5 &#8722; &radic;3</p><p>Difference = (&radic;3 + &radic;5) &#8722; (&radic;5 &#8722; &radic;3) = 2&radic;3</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify: &radic;(7 + 4&radic;3) + &radic;(7 &#8722; 4&radic;3)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;: &radic;(7 + 4&radic;3) + &radic;(7 &#8722; 4&radic;3)</p>", "options_en": ["2", "3", "4", "5"], "options_hi": ["2", "3", "4", "5"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>7 &#177; 4&radic;3 = (&radic;3 &#177; 2)&#178;</p><p>&radic;(7 + 4&radic;3) = &radic;3 + 2</p><p>&radic;(7 &#8722; 4&radic;3) = 2 &#8722; &radic;3</p><p>Sum = (&radic;3 + 2) + (2 &#8722; &radic;3) = 4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>7 &#177; 4&radic;3 = (&radic;3 &#177; 2)&#178;</p><p>&radic;(7 + 4&radic;3) = &radic;3 + 2</p><p>&radic;(7 &#8722; 4&radic;3) = 2 &#8722; &radic;3</p><p>Sum = (&radic;3 + 2) + (2 &#8722; &radic;3) = 4</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If &radic;(108) + &radic;(192) = &radic;(N), what is the value of N?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &radic;(108) + &radic;(192) = &radic;(N) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; N &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["576", "588", "600", "612"], "options_hi": ["576", "588", "600", "612"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Simplify &radic;(108):</p><p>&radic;(108) = &radic;(36 * 3) = 6 * &radic;(3)</p><p>Simplify &radic;(192):</p><p>&radic;(192) = &radic;(64 * 3) = 8 * &radic;(3)</p><p>Add them:</p><p>6 * &radic;(3) + 8 * &radic;(3) = 14 * &radic;(3)</p><p>Since &radic;(N) = 14 * &radic;(3), square both sides:</p><p>N = (14^2) * 3 = 196 * 3 = 588</p><p>Thus, the correct answer is option (2).</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Simplify &radic;(108):</p><p>&radic;(108) = &radic;(36 * 3) = 6 * &radic;(3)</p><p>Simplify &radic;(192):</p><p>&radic;(192) = &radic;(64 * 3) = 8 * &radic;(3)</p><p>Add them:</p><p>6 * &radic;(3) + 8 * &radic;(3) = 14 * &radic;(3)</p><p>Since &radic;(N) = 14 * &radic;(3), square both sides:</p><p>N = (14^2) * 3 = 196 * 3 = 588</p><p>Thus, the correct answer is option (2).</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&radic;50 &#8722; &radic;18 + &radic;8</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&radic;2</span></div></div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&radic;50 &#8722; &radic;18 + &radic;8</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&radic;2</span></div></div></p><p></p>", "options_en": ["2", "3", "4", "&radic;2"], "options_hi": ["2", "3", "4", "&radic;2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>&radic;50 = &radic;(25 X 2) = 5&radic;2</p><p>&radic;18 = &radic;(9 X 2) = 3&radic;2</p><p>&radic;8 = &radic;(4 X 2) = 2&radic;2</p><p>Numerator = 5&radic;2 &#8722; 3&radic;2 + 2&radic;2 = 4&radic;2</p><p>Denominator = &radic;2</p><p>4&radic;2 / &radic;2 = 4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>&radic;50 = &radic;(25 X 2) = 5&radic;2</p><p>&radic;18 = &radic;(9 X 2) = 3&radic;2</p><p>&radic;8 = &radic;(4 X 2) = 2&radic;2</p><p>Numerator = 5&radic;2 &#8722; 3&radic;2 + 2&radic;2 = 4&radic;2</p><p>Denominator = &radic;2</p><p>4&radic;2 / &radic;2 = 4</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify: (&radic;(5 + 2&radic;6) + &radic;(5 &#8722; 2&radic;6))<sup>2</sup></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;: (&radic;(5 + 2&radic;6) + &radic;(5 &#8722; 2&radic;6))<sup>2</sup></p>", "options_en": ["8", "10", "12", "14"], "options_hi": ["8", "10", "12", "14"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let A = &radic;(5 + 2&radic;6) + &radic;(5 &#8722; 2&radic;6)</p><p>A<sup>2</sup> = (&radic;(5+2&radic;6))<sup>2</sup> + 2&radic;((5+2&radic;6)(5&#8722;2&radic;6)) + (&radic;(5&#8722;2&radic;6))<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (5 + 2&radic;6) + 2&radic;(25 &#8722; 24) + (5 &#8722; 2&radic;6)</p><p>= 5 + 2&radic;6 + 2&radic;1 + 5 &#8722; 2&radic;6</p><p>= 10 + 2</p><p>= 12</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let A = &radic;(5 + 2&radic;6) + &radic;(5 &#8722; 2&radic;6)</p><p>A<sup>2</sup> = (&radic;(5+2&radic;6))<sup>2</sup> + 2&radic;((5+2&radic;6)(5&#8722;2&radic;6)) + (&radic;(5&#8722;2&radic;6))<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (5 + 2&radic;6) + 2&radic;(25 &#8722; 24) + (5 &#8722; 2&radic;6)</p><p>= 5 + 2&radic;6 + 2&radic;1 + 5 &#8722; 2&radic;6</p><p>= 10 + 2</p><p>= 12</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">3&radic;5 + &radic;20 &#8722; 2&radic;45</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&radic;5</span></div></div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">3&radic;5 + &radic;20 &#8722; 2&radic;45</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&radic;5</span></div></div></p><p></p>", "options_en": ["1", "&#8722;1", "2", "&#8722;2"], "options_hi": ["1", "&#8722;1", "2", "&#8722;2"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>&radic;20 = 2&radic;5, &radic;45 = 3&radic;5</p><p>Numerator = 3&radic;5 + 2&radic;5  -  2*3&radic;5 = (5&radic;5 &#8722; 6&radic;5) = &#8722;&radic;5</p><p>(3&radic;5 + &radic;20 &#8722; 2&radic;45) / &radic;5 = &#8722;&radic;5 / &radic;5 = &#8722;1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>&radic;20 = 2&radic;5, &radic;45 = 3&radic;5</p><p>Numerator = 3&radic;5 + 2&radic;5  -  2*3&radic;5 = (5&radic;5 &#8722; 6&radic;5) = &#8722;&radic;5</p><p>(3&radic;5 + &radic;20 &#8722; 2&radic;45) / &radic;5 = &#8722;&radic;5 / &radic;5 = &#8722;1</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If (5 - &radic;5)[&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block;